    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A 2-Player Game, Played Entirely in Singleplayer</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DuoQ is an <strong>e-dating sim </strong>about<strong> romancing another person in an online game</strong>. Play alongside Tala, a mysterious stranger met in the fictional FPS game <i>To the Heart</i>. With Tala at your side, you'll solve co-op challenges, learn about her  IRL life, and answer the question: is she into you?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Talk with Tala using your real voice, with open ended conversations, a rich narrative to uncover, and plenty of flirting to do!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Overcome multiplayer-like challenges and puzzles, fully playable in single player</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover collectibles, secrets, and multiple distinct endings</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >...So is this a Multiplayer Game?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nope! DuoQ uses voice recognition to track your conversation with Tala, allowing for real time conversations and history. Tala isn't a real person, but using these new technologies, we can tell a new kind of story through the structure of a multiplayer game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plus, nothing in DuoQ is AI Generated. We use  machine learning to advance the conversation, but we don't use AI to generate voice lines, art, or the story itself. This is a handcrafted game and a labor of love from our team - enjoy!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A 2-Player Game, Played Entirely in Singleplayer</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DuoQ is an <strong>e-dating sim </strong>about<strong> romancing another person in an online game</strong>. Play alongside Tala, a mysterious stranger met in the fictional FPS game <i>To the Heart</i>. With Tala at your side, you'll solve co-op challenges, learn about her  IRL life, and answer the question: is she into you?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Talk with Tala using your real voice, with open ended conversations, a rich narrative to uncover, and plenty of flirting to do!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Overcome multiplayer-like challenges and puzzles, fully playable in single player</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover collectibles, secrets, and multiple distinct endings</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >...So is this a Multiplayer Game?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nope! DuoQ uses voice recognition to track your conversation with Tala, allowing for real time conversations and history. Tala isn't a real person, but using these new technologies, we can tell a new kind of story through the structure of a multiplayer game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plus, nothing in DuoQ is AI Generated. We use  machine learning to advance the conversation, but we don't use AI to generate voice lines, art, or the story itself. This is a handcrafted game and a labor of love from our team - enjoy!</p>",
    "short_description": "Squad up with Tala, a mysterious (and flirty!) player you meet in the lobby of a fictional FPS game. Use your real-life voice to talk with Tala over comms, solve puzzles, and outwit enemies. By the end, you\u2019ll answer the most important question: Is she into you?",
    "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
